      "title": "Whole-time Director exercised options to buy ₹200m worth of stock.",
      "body": "On the 15th of December, Arjunkumar Patel exercised options to buy 1m shares at a strike price of around ₹11.00, costing a total of ₹14m. This transaction amounted to 47% of their direct individual holding at the time of the trade. Since December 2024, Arjunkumar's direct individual holding has increased from 1.31m shares to 4.01m. Company insiders have collectively bought ₹41m more than they sold, via options and on-market transactions, in the last 12 months.",
